{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 36, :comments ["<b>And they shall empty the house before the priest comes.</b> And he shall not come before that; meanwhile there will be a time of repentance and prayer for the owners and a time of prayer for the priest, and with this He has granted a time of quarantine. In the Midrash (Leviticus Rabbah 17:7) they said: all of this alludes to the destruction of the First Temple and its restoration in the Second, and its defilement in the destruction of the Second, and its purification in the Third Temple, which shall be built and established speedily in our days, Amen."], :book :leviticus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:36:17.236115761Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}